{"reviewId": "45311512_7YunY0N0U", "review": {"abstract": "康波的本质表现是价格的波动，而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这里的逻辑其实与一命二运相通，这个命是国运是历史进程的时间点，个人的命运在国家不同的历史周期产生的价值不同，60年的工人出租车，70的红卫兵，80年倒爷，90年下海潮，00年代房地产刺激，10年代IPO，20年代硬科技卡脖子……对应时间点上的专业或人都会富贵，当下就业难但芯片制造岗位200万元以上年薪的人大把大把……", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1237-1294", "createTime": 1741403580, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "45311512_7YunY0N0U", "userVid": 45311512, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1741403600, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 45311512, "name": "默默", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJEUaQsB5bgD6YCM0375uhHXc2pjhl6nxtjgHLNOl5Chibpqibaj88AKgYw2iaOcbVVEBPJ5y3MNl0RA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "默默", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240325-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 76, "likes": [{"userVid": 22693265, "name": "淡然的柠檬", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-0EEWyYy6N231mpv8FRIYGf1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "淡然的柠檬", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIn